  "level_profiles_comment": "ProfileCapabilitySet(L) = Own(L) ∪ ProfileCapabilitySet(parents), over the declared inherits edges (sections 174, 178, 192). Inheritance is explicit, acyclic, and never inferred from the ordering of profile names.",
  "authorization_resolution_comment": "EffectiveCapabilities = (ProfileCapabilities ∩ AuthorizedCapabilities) − DeniedCapabilities. A restriction can only narrow: a capability that does not originate from the selected profile cannot be added (section 178).",
  "transitions_comment": "Lifecycle constraints (section 200). Authorization: NOT_REQUESTED → REQUESTED → GRANTED | DENIED; GRANTED → REVOKED | EXPIRED. Execution: NOT_STARTED → READY → RUNNING → SUCCEEDED | PARTIALLY_SUCCEEDED | FAILED | CANCELLED | STOPPED, plus NOT_STARTED → AUTHORIZATION_BLOCKED. Execution verification: NOT_STARTED → READY → RUNNING → PASSED | PARTIALLY_PASSED | FAILED | BLOCKED | INCONCLUSIVE. These are lifecycle constraints, not descriptive labels."
